## 1. Teacher branches in `App.vue`

**`teacherBranches`** intersects the global `branches` list (from `useBranches`) with **`userProfile.branch_ids`**, which is filled from **`GET /api/v1/me`** as `me.campuses`:

```843:864:/home/admin/frontend/src/App.vue
const teacherBranches = computed(() => {
  const ids = userProfile.value?.branch_ids;
  if (!ids || ids.length === 0) return [];
  const idSet = new Set(ids.map(Number));
  return branches.value.filter(b => idSet.has(b.id));
});

function ensureTeacherBranch() {
  if (!isTeacher.value) return;
  const allowed = teacherBranches.value;
  if (allowed.length > 0) {
    const allowedIds = new Set(allowed.map(b => b.id));
    if (currentBranch.value != null && allowedIds.has(currentBranch.value)) return;
    const preferred = allowed[0].id;
    currentBranch.value = preferred;
    localStorage.setItem('app_branch', String(preferred));
  } else if (branches.value.length > 0) {
    if (currentBranch.value != null && branches.value.some(b => b.id === currentBranch.value)) return;
    currentBranch.value = branches.value[0].id;
    localStorage.setItem('app_branch', String(branches.value[0].id));
  }
}
```

**Imports and `branches` / `loadBranches` usage** (not a local `ref` in `App.vue`—it uses the shared store):

```337:343:/home/admin/frontend/src/App.vue
import {
  branches,
  loadBranches,
  loadBranchesForDirector,
  getDefaultBranchId,
  resolveSavedBranchChoice,
} from './lib/useBranches';
```

**Population flow**

- **`onMounted`**: `await loadBranches()` (public `GET /api/v1/branches`, cached in `useBranches`), then resolves `currentBranch` from `localStorage`.
- **Directors**: `ensureDirectorBranches()` may replace `branches.value` with `loadBranchesForDirector(token)` → `GET /api/v1/campuses`.
- **Teachers**: after `fetchProfile`, `branch_ids` comes from `me.campuses`; `ensureTeacherBranch()` pins `currentBranch` to an allowed campus or falls back to the first global branch.

```895:921:/home/admin/frontend/src/App.vue
onMounted(async () => {
    // ...
    await loadBranches();

    const savedBranch = localStorage.getItem('app_branch');
    const resolved = resolveSavedBranchChoice(savedBranch, branches.value);
    if (resolved != null) {
        currentBranch.value = resolved;
        // ...
    } else {
        currentBranch.value = getDefaultBranchId();
    }

    const { data } = await supabase.auth.getSession();
    session.value = data.session;

    if (session.value) {
        await fetchProfile(session.value.user.id);
        await ensureDirectorBranches();
    }
